  "title": "DWD ICON",
  "description": "An archive of global numerical weather prediction (NWP) model output from Deutscher Wetterdienst (DWD), Germany's national meteorological service, covering the ICON Global and ICON ART Global (aerosol and reactive trace gas) models. It includes ensemble and historical forecast runs with near-global spatial coverage, originally produced in GRIB2 and republished in Zarr/Icechunk format.",
